#, no-c-format
msgid "Xkb Options"
msgstr "Xkb Köylämäse"

#. i18n: file kcmlayoutwidget.ui line 562
#: rc.cpp:119
#, no-c-format
msgid "&Enable xkb options"
msgstr "&xkb köylämäsen açu"

#. i18n: file kcmlayoutwidget.ui line 576
#: rc.cpp:125
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here you can set xkb extension options instead of, or in addition to, "
"specifying them in the X11 configuration file."
msgstr ""
"X11 caylaw biremendä bilgelängän küçergeç urınına (yä aña östämä itep) xkb "
"küçergeçen bonda caylap bula."

#. i18n: file kcmlayoutwidget.ui line 587
#: rc.cpp:128
#, no-c-format
msgid "&Reset old options"
msgstr "İske caylawnı awda&r"

#. i18n: file kcmmiscwidget.ui line 33
#: rc.cpp:137
#, no-c-format
msgid "NumLock on KDE Startup"
msgstr "KDE Cibärgändä NumLock"

#. i18n: file kcmmiscwidget.ui line 36
#: rc.cpp:140
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If supported, this option allows you to setup the state of NumLock after KDE "
"startup."
"<p>You can configure NumLock to be turned on or off, or configure KDE not to "
"set NumLock state."
msgstr ""
"Totılğan bulsa, KDE cibärelgändä NumLock yanuın bu köylämä aşa köyläp bula."
"<p>NumLock açqıçın yä yandırası, yä sünderäse, yä üzgärtmäskä itep caylap bula."

#. i18n: file kcmmiscwidget.ui line 47
#: rc.cpp:143
#, no-c-format
