msgstr "Sü&nek"

#. i18n: file kcmmiscwidget.ui line 58
#: rc.cpp:146
#, no-c-format
msgid "Leave unchan&ged"
msgstr "Üz&gärtmiçä qaldırası"

#. i18n: file kcmmiscwidget.ui line 69
#: rc.cpp:149
#, no-c-format
msgid "T&urn on"
msgstr "&Açıq"

#. i18n: file kcmmiscwidget.ui line 82
#: rc.cpp:152
#, no-c-format
msgid "Keyboard Repeat"
msgstr "Töylek Qabatlawı"

#. i18n: file kcmmiscwidget.ui line 101
#: rc.cpp:155
#, no-c-format
msgid "&Delay:"
msgstr "&Ara:"

#. i18n: file kcmmiscwidget.ui line 136
#: rc.cpp:158 rc.cpp:164
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If supported, this option allows you to set the delay after which a pressed key "
"will start generating keycodes. The 'Repeat rate' option controls the frequency "
"of these keycodes."
msgstr ""
"Totılğan bulsa, töymägä basudan soñ ımlaw cibärä başlağançı kiçekterü arasın bu "
"köylämä aşa köyläp bula. 'Qabatlaw yışlığı' digän köylämä aşa ul ımlawlar "
"yışlığın köyläp bula."

#. i18n: file kcmmiscwidget.ui line 153
#: rc.cpp:161
#, no-c-format
msgid " msec"
msgstr " msek"

#. i18n: file kcmmiscwidget.ui line 172
#: rc.cpp:167
#, no-c-format
msgid "&Rate:"
msgstr "&Dan:"

#. i18n: file kcmmiscwidget.ui line 207
#: rc.cpp:170 rc.cpp:176
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If supported, this option allows you to set the rate at which keycodes are "
"generated while a key is pressed."
msgstr ""
"Totılğan bulsa, töymägä basudan çıqqan ımlaw yışlığın bu köylämä aşa köyläp "
"bula."

#. i18n: file kcmmiscwidget.ui line 227
#: rc.cpp:173
#, no-c-format
msgid "/s"
msgstr "/s"

#. i18n: file kcmmiscwidget.ui line 238
#: rc.cpp:179
#, no-c-format
msgid "&Enable keyboard repeat"
msgstr "&Töylek qabatlanuın açu"

#. i18n: file kcmmiscwidget.ui line 244
#: rc.cpp:182
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you check this option, pressing and holding down a key emits the same "
"character over and over again. For example, pressing and holding down the Tab "
"key will have the same effect as that of pressing that key several times in "
"succession: Tab characters continue to be emitted until you release the key."
msgstr ""
"Bu köylämä yanıq bulsa, töymälärgä basıp totqanda ul töymägä berniçä tapqır "
"basqan kebek bulaçaq. "

#. i18n: file kcmmiscwidget.ui line 263
#: rc.cpp:185
#, no-c-format
msgid "%"
msgstr "%"

#. i18n: file kcmmiscwidget.ui line 266
#: rc.cpp:188 rc.cpp:194
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If supported, this option allows you to hear audible clicks from your "
"computer's speakers when you press the keys on your keyboard. This might be "
"useful if your keyboard does not have mechanical keys, or if the sound that the "
"keys make is very soft."
"<p>You can change the loudness of the key click feedback by dragging the slider "
"button or by clicking the up/down arrows on the spin box. Setting the volume to "
"0% turns off the key click."
msgstr ""
"Totılğan bulsa, töymä basuların sanaqnıñ söylätkeçläre aşa işeterlek itüne bu "
"köylämä aşa açıp bula. Töylekneñ töymäläre çın bulmağanda, yä ki annan çıqqan "
"tawış bik neçkä ikän, ul çaqta bu köylämädän uñaylıq kürep bula."
"<p>Sudırma töymäsen österep çirteş tawışın üzgärtep bula."

#. i18n: file kcmmiscwidget.ui line 282
#: rc.cpp:191
#, no-c-format
msgid "Key click &volume:"
msgstr "Töymä çirtü &köçe:"

